<!--
niva User Defined Language for Notepad++ (v0.37)

Import: Language → User Defined Language → Import → pick this file
Then select: Language → niva

Auto-detects .niva extension. Supports:
  · Built-in verbs (dark green)    · Alias verbs (burnt orange)
  · Comments (# to end of line)    · Double/single quoted strings (olive)
  · Pipe |  and  key=value         · EPSG:NNNN CRS codes
  · @conn connection refs          · Flags & mode values (slate blue)
  · Numbers and distances (100m)   · Common option keywords
